# Composition-detector control fixtures (#140) — DERIVED data, 58 MB of PNGs
# rebuilt from the committed jet-free backgrounds by make_control.py, which
# selftest.sh runs automatically. Committing them would more than double the
# repo and they go stale the moment the jet art changes.
.claude/skills/composition-metrics/control/generated/

# Extracted reference frames — local development reference only.
# This repo is public; committing frames from copyrighted arcade footage
